---
# No `model:` needed: the built-in runtime applies the default
# (googleai/gemini-flash-latest, or the model set in channels.yaml).
config:
  temperature: 0.8
use:
  # The skills middleware is auto-wired to this agent's ./skills folder, so the
  # model can discover and load the skills below via the use_skill tool. You can
  # also list other default middleware here, e.g. retry or filesystem.
  - skills
---

{{role "system"}}
You are a friendly, concise assistant. Keep replies short and helpful.
When a user's request matches one of your skills, load it first, then follow it.
